# 🐹 Go Module Patterns

## Module Structure

### Root Module
```go
module github.com/jenova-marie/caddy-spire-client
```

### Package Organization
```
pkg/
├── spire/           # Core SPIRE client implementation
│   └── client.go    # Main client interface
└── caddyspire/      # Caddy module integration
    └── module.go    # Caddy certificate issuer
```

## Import Patterns

### Internal Package Imports
```go
// Always use full module path for internal imports
import "github.com/jenova-marie/caddy-spire-client/pkg/spire"
import "github.com/jenova-marie/caddy-spire-client/pkg/caddyspire"
```

### External Dependencies
```go
// SPIFFE/SPIRE libraries
import "github.com/spiffe/go-spiffe/v2/svid/x509svid"
import "github.com/spiffe/go-spiffe/v2/workloadapi"

// Caddy framework
import "github.com/caddyserver/caddy/v2"
import caddycmd "github.com/caddyserver/caddy/v2/cmd"

// Testing framework
import "github.com/stretchr/testify/assert"
import "github.com/stretchr/testify/mock"

// Logging
import "go.uber.org/zap"
```

## Test File Organization

### Test Import Pattern
```go
// Test files should import from the same package
package spire_test  // External test package

import (
    "testing"
    "github.com/jenova-marie/caddy-spire-client/pkg/spire"
    "github.com/jenova-marie/caddy-spire-client/tests/mocks"
)
```

### Mock Import Pattern
```go
// Mock files in tests/mocks/
import "github.com/jenova-marie/caddy-spire-client/tests/mocks"
```

## Binary Command Patterns

### Main Command Structure
```go
// cmd/caddy-spire-client/main.go
package main

import (
    "context"
    "flag"
    "github.com/jenova-marie/caddy-spire-client/pkg/spire"
)

func main() {
    // Handle flags, setup, and run
}
```

### Caddy Integration Command
```go
// cmd/caddy-with-spire/main.go
package main

import (
    caddycmd "github.com/caddyserver/caddy/v2/cmd"
    _ "github.com/caddyserver/caddy/v2/modules/standard"
    _ "github.com/jenova-marie/caddy-spire-client/pkg/caddyspire"
)

func main() {
    caddycmd.Main()
}
```

## Go Module Dependencies

### Core Dependencies
```go
require (
    github.com/caddyserver/caddy/v2 v2.10.0
    github.com/spiffe/go-spiffe/v2 v2.4.0
    github.com/stretchr/testify v1.10.0
    go.uber.org/zap v1.27.0
)
```

### Version Management
- Use `go mod tidy` after adding dependencies
- Pin to specific versions for stability
- Update dependencies regularly with `go get -u`

## Package Interface Patterns

### Client Interface Design
```go
type SPIREClient interface {
    GetSVID(ctx context.Context) (*x509svid.SVID, error)
    GetTLSConfig() *tls.Config
    Close() error
}
```

### Configuration Patterns
```go
type Config struct {
    SocketPath      string        `json:"socket_path"`
    RefreshInterval time.Duration `json:"refresh_interval"`
    TrustDomain     string        `json:"trust_domain"`
}
```

## Build Tags and Conditional Compilation

### Test Build Tags
